"description":"Your experience counts. Make it part of your next application.\n\nMoving beyond service, retail, gig work, or another hands-on role? Way In helps you explain what you already know how to do, check it against a real job, and keep your next steps together.\n\nA PRIVATE RÉSUMÉ AND APPLICATION WORKSPACE\nStart with a few true sentences or import an existing résumé. Work, school, projects, caregiving, and volunteering all count. Build from your own experience and review every suggestion before using it.\n\nSEE WHAT FITS\nSave a job posting and compare its requirements with your experience. See supported experience, related experience, and gaps, with source excerpts where available. Use that context to decide what to strengthen next.\n\nKEEP THE WHOLE APPLICATION TOGETHER\nOrganize saved jobs, résumé versions, application progress, notes, and follow-ups. Prepare your materials, submit through the employer’s website, and record what happened. Way In does not apply on your behalf.\n\nSTART FREE\nCapture experience, start or import a résumé, save jobs, and check job fit. No account is required. Full review, editing, and export of saved résumés require an eligible purchase.\n\nRESUME TOOLKIT — ONE PAYMENT\nUnlock full saved-résumé review and editing, plus PDF and editable DOCX export. A non-consumable purchase with no time limit.\n\n30-DAY CAREER PASS — NO AUTO-RENEWAL\nGet résumé access, job-specific tailoring, application drafts, interview preparation, and career planning for 30 days from purchase. The pass expires automatically. Toolkit is not required; permanent Toolkit access is a separate purchase.\n\nApple shows your local price before purchase. Restore purchases from Settings using the Apple Account that paid. Restoring an expired pass does not restart it. Saved work stays on your device and exported files remain yours after access expires.\n\nPRIVATE BY DEFAULT\nCareer work is stored on your device. The native app does not send résumé text to a cloud AI service. Optional iCloud continuity uses your private iCloud Drive. You choose when to export, share, or sync. Opening a job link contacts the destination website.\n\nWay In is a preparation and organization tool, not a recruiter or a guarantee of interviews, offers, or applicant-tracking-system results. Check your facts and materials before submitting.\n\nSupport: https://koinophobialabs.com/way-in/support\nPrivacy: https://koinophobialabs.com/way-in/privacy\nTerms: https://koinophobialabs.com/way-in/terms\nApple Standard EULA: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"9578496", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "sellerUrl":"https://koinophobialabs.com/way-in", "bundleId":"com.koinophobialabs.careerapp", "sellerName":"BLAKE JIHAD TAYLOR", "userRatingCount":0}, 
