"description":"Trendi is a content coach for creators who know what they want to say but get stuck between the thought and the record button.\n\nType or speak a rough thought. When you choose Shape This Into a Video, Trendi recommends one clear angle, three hook options, an editable script, a caption, a simple shot plan, and a concise explanation of why the structure works.\n\nCapture ideas by text or speech, choose the hook that fits, edit the script in your own words, copy what you need, and record section by section or as a full script with an on-screen teleprompter. Keep ideas and drafts in your on-device Vault, add performance notes manually, and guide future coaching with Creator Playbook information you choose to add.\n\nTrendi is free to use and includes up to three successfully generated Coach Packs per weekly allowance period. Trendi Pro, an optional auto-renewing monthly subscription, provides 100 Coach Packs each month. Only successfully delivered Coach Packs count against your allowance. Everything else in Trendi stays the same on the free plan.\n\nTrendi Pro subscriptions are charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase and renew automatically each month unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store account settings.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://koinophobialabs.com/trendi/privacy\n\nTrendi does not automatically post or schedule content, connect to social accounts, or guarantee views, followers, revenue, or growth. Coaching suggestions are examples to review and adapt. You remain the author.", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"9333760", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":6, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "sellerUrl":"https://koinophobialabs.com/trendi", "bundleId":"app.aic.mobile", "sellerName":"BLAKE JIHAD TAYLOR", "userR